","text":"@Nerdy_Addict My son had HMPV awhile back. No testing except at ER we were at. Fever of 102 I believe. Wound up getting viral pneumonia from it &amp; was sick for a week. A week after it, he almost got admitted to the hospital due to his o2 &amp; heart rate. It was terrifying. He was 6 at the time","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":2.315,"parent_id":"1875368837748826350","conversation_id":"1875368837748826350"},{"id":"1875400729214562752","x":0.02661,"y":10.0,"t":1735965351,"iso":"2025-01-04T04:35:51.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"jstepp","author_id":"24517509","text":"I don’t know of that is what has hit here but I know several people to include myself who have this weird respiratory thing. Severe cough, feel terrible, some congestion but not much. And in 10-14 days completely gone. All of them have tested negative for flu, strep, and Covid. I don’t test but antibiotics did nothing. I am never sick, immunity against common stuff for years but it kicked my tail in November.","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":2.112,"parent_id":"1875368837748826350","conversation_id":"1875368837748826350"},{"id":"1875546246653604059","x":0.148037,"y":10.0,"t":1736000045,"iso":"2025-01-04T14:14:05.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"Sunnymorning17","author_id":"1444035645601583104","text":"@jstepp @Nerdy_Addict I’ve been sick, but my son also had RSV. The waste water testing website had high traces for Covid , RSV and influenza A for multiple areas in the US","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":11.749,"parent_id":"1875400729214562752","conversation_id":"1875368837748826350"},{"id":"1875554519008031144","x":0.154942,"y":10.0,"t":1736002018,"iso":"2025-01-04T14:46:58.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"jstepp","autho